v-item-description">Operationalize agentic AI with connected intelligence</p></a></li><li><a href="/platform/integrations"><p class="header-nav-item-title">Integrations​</p><p class="header-nav-item-description">Seamlessly connect business systems with an open and flexible AI platform​</p></a></li><li><a href="/platform/cloud-architecture"><p class="header-nav-item-title">Cloud Architecture​</p><p class="header-nav-item-description">Rapidly transform and scale your CX on an innovative open-cloud foundation​</p></a></li><li><a href="https://www.nice.com/company/trust-center"><p class="header-nav-item-title">Trust Center​</p><p class="header-nav-item-description">Reliability, security, and compliance that drives enterprise AI innovation​</p></a></li></ul></div><div class=" separator"><p class="header-nav-inner-col-title"></p><ul><li><a href="/platform/agent-workspace"><p class="header-nav-item-title">Agent Workspace​</p><p class="header-nav-item-description">Empower human agents and supervisors with intelligent workspaces.</p></a></li><li><a href="/platform/supervisor-workspace"><p class="header-nav-item-title">Supervisor Workspace​</p><p class="header-nav-item-description">Empower human agents and supervisors with intelligent workspaces. </p></a></li><li><a href="/platform/global-voice-coverage"><p class="header-nav-item-title">Global Voice Coverage</p><p class="header-nav-item-description">Expansive, high-quality voice coverage across the globe.</p></a></li></ul></div><div class=""><p class="header-nav-inner-col-title">Platform capabilities​</p><ul><li><a href="/products/agentic-experience-automation"><p class="header-nav-item-title">Agentic Experience Automation​</p><p class="header-nav-item-description">AI that resolves customer needs instantly and proactively​</p></a></li><li><a href="/products/engagement-orchestration"><p class="header-nav-item-title">Engagement Orchestration​</p><p class="header-nav-item-description">AI-driven orchestration that streamlines ser