                 <div class="price-text-wrap">                                    <p>NiCE for Medicaid</p>                                    <img src="/pricing-assets/img/price-tables/info.svg" alt="">                                    <div class="tooltip-text">Managing communication and engagement with beneficiaries, ensuring smoother enrollment processes, compliance, and ongoing recipient journey and program success</div>                                </div>                            </div>                            <div class="price-table-line grey">                                <div class="price-text-wrap">                                    <p>NiCE for Education**</p>                                    <img src="/pricing-assets/img/price-tables/info.svg" alt="">                                    <div class="tooltip-text">Helping universities enhance student engagement, prevent attrition, and foster student success by offering proactive, personalized, omnichannel communications addressing student needs throughout their application and academic journey</div>                                </div>                            </div>                            <div class="price-table-line">                                <div class="price-text-wrap">                                    <p>NiCE for Pension Systems</p>                                    <img src="/pricing-assets/img/price-tables/info.svg" alt="">                                    <div class="tooltip-text">Proactive two-way communication with members at the best time, channel, automatically notifying members about deadlines, payment reminders or missing documents</div>                                </div>                            </div>                            <div class="price-table-line">                                <div class="price-text-wrap">                                    <p></p>                                </div>                            </div>                        </div>                    </div>                    <div class="notes">                        <p>* Voice biometrics, EHR integration, Proactive engagement AI agent are add-ons</p>                        <p>** Price On Application</p>                    </div>                </div>            </div>        </div>    </div>    <section class="text-section">        <div class="container">            <h2>Ready to unlock the power of <br>one unified platform?</h2>            <p>CXone delivers flexible pricing and scalable capabilities to fit your unique business <br>needs. Deploy exactly what you need—when you need it—and realize value fast. <br>Let’s talk. Get a personalized quote today.</p>            <div class="btn-wrap">                <a href="https://www.nice.com/get-quote" class="button-nice button-play button-white" target="_blank">Request a quote</a>            </div>        </div>    </section></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><!--/$--><footer class="footer-nova"><div class="be-ix-link-block"><!--Link Block Target Div--></div><div class="footer-inner"><div class="footer-column"><a href="#" class="footer-company-logo"><img src="/img/nice-smile.svg" class="nice-smile" alt="NICE"/></a></div><div class="footer-column"><h4>Company</h4><div class="dropdown"><ul><li><a href="/company/about-us" aria-label="About Us - open in same tab">About Us</a></li><li><a href="/careers" aria-label="Careers - open in same tab">Careers</a></li><li><a href="/company/global-leadership" aria-label="Global Leadership - open in same tab">Global Leadership</a></li><li><a href="/company/media-center" aria-label="Media Center - open in same tab">Media Center</a></li><li><a href="/company/investors" aria-label="Investors - open in same tab">Investors</a></li><li><a href="/company/awards" aria-label="Awards - open in same tab">Awards</a></li><li><a href="/company/global-locations" aria-label="Global Office Locations - o